# OBJ   | objective  | attrs      | H | Working        | Active goal
# SES   | session    | attrs      | M | Episodic       | Compressed episode
# HDL   | handoff    | attrs      | M | Episodic       | Work handed between agents
# AUD   | audit      | attrs      | M | Prefrontal     | Verification record
# LNG   | lesson     | attrs      | M | Episodic       | Learned lesson
# WRK   | work       | attrs      | B | Working        | Current execution state
# RSK   | risk       | attrs      | M | Prefrontal     | Risk with mitigation
# KNW   | knowledge  | attrs      | B | Semantic       | Stable knowledge
# ERR   | error      | attrs      | M | Concurrency    | Optimistic-locking state
# ARQX  | artifact   | attrs      | B | Semantic       | Artifact metadata
#
# Types:
# attrs = canonical type
# cuerpo = canonical type
#
# Micro-glossary:
# cur=current wrk=work min=minimum ok=success


